  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Western Balkans SALW control roadmap, Multi-partner Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Western Balkans Small Arms and Light Weapons  (SALW) Control Roadmap Multi-Partner Trust Fund is set up to support the implementation of the Roadmap for a sustainable solution to the illegal possession, misuse and trafficking of Small Arms and Light Weapons and their ammunition in the Western Balkans by 2024 (the Roadmap).</narrative>
  </description>
